      "problem": "The algebraic expression $4w-3$ can be translated into a sentence as",
      "worked_solution": "The first term of the expression is $4w$ and this can be written as \"four times a number\".\n\nSince we have the subtraction $4w-3$, the whole expression can be written as \"the difference between four times a number and three\".",
