    "q-184024": {
      "dom_id": "step-q184024",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Translate the following phrase into an algebraic expression: \"$20$ minus five times a number.\"\n\nUse the letter $w$ to represent the unknown number.\n\n{{field-1}}",
      "worked_solution": "If we denote our number by $w$, then \"five times a number'' can be written as\n\n$$\n5w.\n$$\n\nSo, the whole phrase can be written as\n\n$$\n20-5w.\n$$",
