      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "Write \"the quotient of a number and three\" as an algebraic expression.",
      "worked_solution": "\"The quotient of a number and three\" means the same thing as \"a number divided by three.\" \n\nIf we call our number $n$, then we can express this mathematically as $\\frac{n}{3}.$",
